{"seq":3,"slug":"dbaas-monitoring-tuning","title":"DBaaS 监控与调优实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/operations-migration/dbaas-monitoring-tuning","wordCount":1811,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"dbaas-监控与调优实践\">DBaaS 监控与调优实践</h1><p>数据库上云后，「不用管基础设施」是一个危险的误解。托管服务免去了 OS 补丁和硬件维护，但性能调优、容量规划、成本控制和故障响应仍然是应用团队的责任。区别在于：自建数据库你调 Linux 内核参数和磁盘调度器，DBaaS 你调连接池配置、索引策略和实例规格——杠杆不同，但优化的思维方式相同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>DBaaS 监控与调优的三个核心框架：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>监控金字塔四层</strong>：业务指标 → 应用指标 → 数据库指标 → 基础设施指标——从上往下排查，从下往上预防</li>\n<li><strong>调优 ROI 排序</strong>：优先优化高频中延迟查询（ROI 最高），而非低频超慢查询</li>\n<li><strong>成本七杠杆</strong>：预留实例 &gt; 右调规格 &gt; 存储优化 &gt; 副本清理 &gt; 备份缩短 &gt; 跨 AZ 优化 &gt; 非生产停机</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"监控金字塔\">监控金字塔</h2><p>DBaaS 监控按从粗到细分为四层，每层回答不同的问题：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    L1[L1: 业务指标] --&gt; L2[L2: 应用指标]&#10;    L2 --&gt; L3[L3: 数据库指标]&#10;    L3 --&gt; L4[L4: 基础设施指标]&#10;    L1 -.-&gt;|&quot;订单成功率下降&quot;| Q1[问题: 用户受影响了吗?]&#10;    L2 -.-&gt;|&quot;API P99 升高&quot;| Q2[问题: 哪个服务慢了?]&#10;    L3 -.-&gt;|&quot;锁等待增加&quot;| Q3[问题: 数据库怎么了?]&#10;    L4 -.-&gt;|&quot;CPU 95%&quot;| Q4[问题: 要扩容吗?]\">graph TD\n    L1[L1: 业务指标] --&gt; L2[L2: 应用指标]\n    L2 --&gt; L3[L3: 数据库指标]\n    L3 --&gt; L4[L4: 基础设施指标]\n    L1 -.-&gt;|\"订单成功率下降\"| Q1[问题: 用户受影响了吗?]\n    L2 -.-&gt;|\"API P99 升高\"| Q2[问题: 哪个服务慢了?]\n    L3 -.-&gt;|\"锁等待增加\"| Q3[问题: 数据库怎么了?]\n    L4 -.-&gt;|\"CPU 95%\"| Q4[问题: 要扩容吗?]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>关键指标</th>\n<th>数据源</th>\n<th>告警阈值设计</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 业务</td>\n<td>转化率、支付成功率</td>\n<td>APM / 业务埋点</td>\n<td>基于历史同期偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 应用</td>\n<td>API 延迟、错误率、连接池使用率</td>\n<td>APM / 应用日志</td>\n<td>P99 &gt; 2x baseline</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 数据库</td>\n<td>QPS、慢查询数、复制延迟、锁等待</td>\n<td>云监控 / pg_stat</td>\n<td>绝对阈值 + 变化率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 基础设施</td>\n<td>CPU、内存、IOPS、网络</td>\n<td>CloudWatch / Stackdriver</td>\n<td>&gt;80% 持续 5min</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键原则：<strong>从上往下排查，从下往上预防</strong>。告警应该优先触发在 L1/L2（用户可感知的影响），但容量预警应设在 L3/L4（在用户感知前介入）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心数据库指标详解\">核心数据库指标详解</h2><h3 id=\"连接管理\">连接管理</h3><p>连接数是 DBaaS 中最常见的瓶颈。每个连接消耗的内存：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{conn} \\approx M_{stack} + M_{sort\\_buffer} + M_{temp\\_table}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nn</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">sor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>PostgreSQL 默认每连接约 5-10 MB，MySQL 约 2-5 MB。实例的最大连接数通常由内存限制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{max\\_conn} \\approx \\frac{M_{available}}{M_{conn}} \\times 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nn</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nn</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>连接池是必需品，不是可选项</strong>。对于 serverless 函数（Lambda/Cloud Functions）场景，每次调用都新建连接会迅速耗尽连接限制。解决方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n<th>延迟增加</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>应用内连接池</td>\n<td>HikariCP / node-postgres pool</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>长运行服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部代理</td>\n<td>PgBouncer / ProxySQL</td>\n<td>1-3ms</td>\n<td>多服务共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>托管代理</td>\n<td>RDS Proxy / AlloyDB Auth Proxy</td>\n<td>1-5ms</td>\n<td>Serverless 函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Serverless 驱动</td>\n<td>Neon serverless driver / PlanetScale HTTP</td>\n<td>变化大</td>\n<td>Edge 函数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"查询性能\">查询性能</h3><p>慢查询是数据库性能退化的首要原因。建立查询性能基线的步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>开启 <code>pg_stat_statements</code>（PG）或 Performance Insights（Aurora/RDS）</li>\n<li>按 <code>total_exec_time</code> 排序取 Top 20 查询</li>\n<li>记录每个查询的 P50/P95/P99 和调用频率</li>\n<li>设定告警：P99 &gt; 3x baseline 或 调用频率突增 &gt; 2x</li>\n</ol>\n<p>查询优化的 ROI 估算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ROI_{query} = \\frac{calls\\_per\\_day \\times (latency_{before} - latency_{after})}{time\\_to\\_optimize}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.446em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">imi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;