pace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mainin</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{remaining}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mainin</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是剩余容量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{growth}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是增长速率。当预估耗尽时间 &lt; 阈值（如 14 天）时触发预警。</p>\n<p>关键容量维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>监控指标</th>\n<th>扩展方式</th>\n<th>扩展延迟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CPU</td>\n<td>平均利用率 + 峰值</td>\n<td>垂直扩容 / 读副本</td>\n<td>分钟级（Aurora）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存</td>\n<td>Buffer cache hit ratio</td>\n<td>垂直扩容</td>\n<td>需重启（部分）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储</td>\n<td>已用 / 总量</td>\n<td>自动扩展（多数服务）</td>\n<td>无感知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IOPS</td>\n<td>实际 / 预置</td>\n<td>调整 IOPS 配置</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接数</td>\n<td>活跃 / 最大</td>\n<td>连接池 / 代理</td>\n<td>配置级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"成本优化清单\">成本优化清单</h2><p>DBaaS 成本优化的七个杠杆，按 ROI 从高到低排序：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>预留实例</strong>：对稳定工作负载，1 年预留可节省 30-40%，3 年节省 50-60%</li>\n<li><strong>实例规格右调（Right-sizing）</strong>：CPU &lt; 40% 持续 2 周 → 降一档</li>\n<li><strong>存储类型优化</strong>：Aurora I/O-Optimized 或 gp3 IOPS 调低</li>\n<li><strong>读副本清理</strong>：未被使用的副本 → 删除</li>\n<li><strong>备份保留缩短</strong>：生产保留 7-14 天足够，非生产 3 天</li>\n<li><strong>跨 AZ 流量优化</strong>：读请求路由到同 AZ 副本</li>\n<li><strong>非生产环境停机</strong>：开发/测试库非工作时间自动暂停（Aurora Serverless / Neon scale-to-zero）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>成本优化与性能之间的平衡公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cost_efficiency</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cost\\_efficiency} = \\frac{QPS_{sustained}}{monthly\\_cost}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost_efficiency</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3563em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">cos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">QP</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>追踪这个比率的趋势——如果它下降，说明要么流量降了（考虑缩容），要么性能退化了（需要调优）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"故障响应-runbook-模板\">故障响应 Runbook 模板</h2><p>每个 DBaaS 环境应该预先准备标准 runbook，覆盖最常见的故障场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>故障类型</th>\n<th>首要检查</th>\n<th>快速缓解</th>\n<th>根因分析方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>连接耗尽</td>\n<td>活跃连接列表</td>\n<td>杀空闲连接、扩连接池</td>\n<td>连接泄漏 / 缺少池化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 飙升</td>\n<td>Top SQL by CPU</td>\n<td>杀长查询、添加索引</td>\n<td>缺失索引 / 全表扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复制延迟</td>\n<td>副本 IO/SQL 线程状态</td>\n<td>减少副本负载</td>\n<td>大事务 / 长 DDL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储满</td>\n<td>大表列表 + 临时文件</td>\n<td>清理 temp / 扩容</td>\n<td>未归档历史数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锁等待</td>\n<td><code>pg_locks</code> / <code>SHOW ENGINE INNODB STATUS</code></td>\n<td>杀阻塞者</td>\n<td>事务设计问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>完成监控体系建设后，整个选型-迁移-运维链路闭环。回到 <a href=\"migration-strategy-patterns\">迁移策略与模式</a> 确认切换后的验证指标，或回到 <a href=\"multi-database-polyglot\">多数据库混用架构</a> 检查统一监控面板是否覆盖了所有库。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>DBaaS 的「托管」免去了基础设施维护，但性能调优、容量规划和成本控制仍是应用团队的责任。监控的核心原则是从业务影响出发排查、从基础设施层面预防。调优的最大杠杆通常不是参数微调，而是正确的连接池配置（避免连接耗尽）和索引策略（消除全表扫描）。成本优化的第一步永远是 right-sizing——超过 50% 的 DBaaS 实例在持续低利用率下运行。建立自动化的容量预警（预估耗尽时间 &lt; 14 天告警）和定期成本审查（月度对账单分析）是 DBaaS 运维的基线纪律。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DBaaS 监控与调优实践","id":"dbaas-监控与调优实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"监控金字塔","id":"监控金字塔"},{"level":2,"text":"核心数据库指标详解","id":"核心数据库指标详解"},{"level":3,"text":"连接管理","id":"连接管理"},{"level":3,"text":"查询性能","id":"查询性能"},{"level":3,"text":"存储与 IOPS","id":"存储与-iops"},{"level":2,"text":"自动调优工具链","id":"自动调优工具链"},{"level":2,"text":"容量规划与预警","id":"容量规划与预警"},{"level":2,"text":"成本优化清单","id":"成本优化清单"},{"level":2,"text":"故障响应 Runbook 模板","id":"故障响应-runbook-模板"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多数据库混用架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/operations-migration/multi-database-polyglot"},"next":null}